 more human-like interactions, understand context in user queries, effectively qualify leads, and support multiple languages, therefore enhancing the lead generation process.\"}),`\n`]})}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h2,{id:\"why-lead-generation-chatbots-are-great-for-your-business\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#why-lead-generation-chatbots-are-great-for-your-business\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Why Lead Generation Chatbots are Great for Your Business\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Lead-generation chatbots\"}),\" are AI-powered tools designed to automate interactions between your business and potential customers. These chatbots do more than just collect information. They engage users in a conversation, making the experience both personal and engaging. This mix of automation and personalization keeps potential customers interested and greatly reduces the chance of them leaving your site without taking action.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(c,{typebot:\"lead-generation-0rbhgp3\"}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"Lead generation chatbots are revolutionizing how businesses connect with potential customers online. They are not just futuristic gadgets but current solutions to many marketing and sales challenges. Let's look into the reasons \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"why lead generation chatbots are beneficial\"}),\" for your business.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"tailored-experiences\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#tailored-experiences\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Tailored Experiences\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"At their heart, chatbots can offer \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"customized interactions\"}),\". They adapt their responses based on how a user interacts. This leads to a more relevant and personal journey for each customer. Such personalization makes customers feel valued and understood, increasing the chance of a sale.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"increased-engagement\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#increased-engagement\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Increased Engagement\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"Businesses are no longer confined to traditional office hours thanks to chatbots. They ensure your brand engages with potential leads round the clock. By starting conversations and providing immediate answers, chatbots \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"boost engagement rates\"}),\". Customers get timely information, and your business captures more leads.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"higher-conversion-rates\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#higher-conversion-rates\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Higher Conversion Rates\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"Chatbots proactively engage visitors and offer instant help, guiding them towards a decision. This could be signing up for a newsletter, booking a demo, or making a purchase. \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Chatbots effectively push users down the sales funnel\"}),\", increasing conversion rates. They make the next step feel easy and natural.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"convenience-and-real-time-reactions\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#convenience-and-real-time-reactions\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Convenience and Real-Time Reactions\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"The immediate assistance chatbots provide is invaluable. They answer common questions, solve issues, and even help with bookings or purchases. This \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"real-time interaction\"}),\" removes the wait for a response, thus lowering bounce rates and boosting customer satisfaction.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"lower-cost-per-lead-and-accessibility\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#lower-cost-per-lead-and-accessibility\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Lower Cost Per Lead and Accessibility\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"A chatbot is an upfront investment with ongoing returns without the constant costs of human involvement. Automating the lead generation process \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"cuts down the cost per lead\"}),\". Plus, chatbots offer \",(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"multilingual support\"}),\", reaching a wider audience without extra cost or effort.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h2,{id:\"step-by-step-setup-guide-using-typebot\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#step-by-step-setup-guide-using-typebot\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Step-by-Step Setup Guide Using Typebot\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.ol,{children:[`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Create a New Typebot\"}),\": First, sign up and log in to Typebot. From the dashboard, create a new chatbot.\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(a,{src:\"/blog-assets/lead-generation-chatbot/create-new-typebot.png\",alt:\"How to create a new Typebot\",width:\"2000\",height:\"1019\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Create a Welcome Message\"}),`: Use the Typebot builder to design your conversation\\r\nflow. Start with an engaging greeting to welcome users.`]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(a,{src:\"/blog-assets/lead-generation-chatbot/create-welcome-message.gif\",alt:\"How to create a welcome message in Typebot\",width:\"800\",height:\"631\"}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.strong,