n`,(0,n.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"One of the standout features of AI in chatbots is the ability to support several languages. This opens up global markets to businesses, allowing them to connect with a wider audience without needing a big multilingual team.\"}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h1,{id:\"how-famous-companies-use-chatbotss-to-generate-leads\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#how-famous-companies-use-chatbotss-to-generate-leads\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"How Famous Companies use chatbotss to generate leads\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"pendoio-lets-you-skip-the-contact-form-through-the-chatbot\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#pendoio-lets-you-skip-the-contact-form-through-the-chatbot\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Pendo.io Lets You Skip the Contact Form Through the Chatbot\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(a,{src:\"/blog-assets/lead-generation-chatbot/pendo-chatbot-example.png\",alt:\"Pendo Chatbot Example\",width:\"2000\",height:\"3054\"}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"Pendo.io has transformed lead capture by allowing users to interact directly with a chatbot instead of filling out traditional contact forms. This method speeds up the information collection process and creates a more engaging user experience.\"}),`\n`,(0,n.jsxs)(e.h3,{id:\"intercom-uses-chatbot-to-let-you-talk-to-an-expert\",children:[(0,n.jsx)(e.a,{className:\"subheading-anchor\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to section\",href:\"#intercom-uses-chatbot-to-let-you-talk-to-an-expert\",children:(0,n.jsx)(e.span,{className:\"icon icon-link\"})}),\"Intercom Uses Chatbot to Let You Talk to an Expert\"]}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(a,{src:\"/blog-assets/lead-generation-chatbot/intercom-chatbot-example.png\",alt:\"Intercom Chatbot Example\",width:\"2000\",height:\"3444\"}),`\n`,(0,n.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"Intercom employs its chatbot in a uniqu